  - frame-theory
  - ltfat
abstract: >-
  cool-frames is the frame-theory layer of COOL (Computational
  Orchestration and Listening): a Python port and redesign of the LTFAT
  filterbank module providing auditory, wavelet, constant-Q, Gabor and
  warped filter design with exact analysis/synthesis and phase
  retrieval, in NumPy and PyTorch. It includes a property-based test
  suite grounded in frame theory for cross-language validation against
  MATLAB LTFAT.
